  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.16 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Licensing for Foresters",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.16 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Licensing for Foresters. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.16, below, shall apply to the profession regulated by the board of licensing for foresters under RSA 310-A:98-117:\n\nTable 1002.16 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Licensing for Foresters\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nForester license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $132\n\nSource. #13703, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
